  "description": "Beautifully presented three bedroom house, conveniently located in a private setting in Cavan close to the town centre. The property can be provided either fully furnished or unfurnished. \nThe house has wooden floors in the living room and bedrooms and tiled floor in the kitchen area. It is south facing with access from the kitchen/dining out to the large well maintained private garden. \nThere is secure, off-street parking for the house.\n\nAccommodation consists of:\nFully fitted Kitchen/dining area with patio doors to new outside garden area.\nSeparate living area with open fire with access into the kitchen/diner\n3 Bedrooms (2 double, 1 single), all with new beds\n1 bathrooms\nLarge well maintained private garden with paved area. Suitable for outside dining and BBQ area.\n\nLong term lease available. Rent is paid monthly and 1 month deposit is required.\nReferees required prior to property viewing.",
